      "message": "The side effects of this API are not immediately clear.\nDo you mean that the value will be directly used to encrypt requested AD types;  or that the value will be pushed to the GATT server to update the characteristic ?\n\n- If the first case: I don\u0027t think the value should be provided by the API user;\n  internally it should be queried from the GATT server.\n\n- If the latter case: it becomes very ambiguous when say different keys are passed to adv_data, scan_resp, periodic_adv_data in StartAdvertisingSet.",
